<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT plans venture in cable television.</title>
<headline>PLDT plans venture in cable television.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT), the country's largest telephone company, plans to go into wireless cable television, an industry source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Talks are ongoing for a possible joint venture with television network GMA-7, he said.</p>
<p>&quot;There 's a plan,&quot; the source confirmed.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, newspaper Businessworld reported that PLDT and GMA-7 had formed a new company called Cable Entertainment Corp.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
